# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum subspace diagonalization tools {#quantum-subspace-diagonalization-tools}"
msgstr "Alat pepenjuruan subruang kuantum {#quantum-subspace-diagonalization-tools}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These tools provide capabilities for building workflows to estimate the eigenvalues of quantum Hamiltonians, like the ground state energy of a molecule, using approaches such as sample-based quantum diagonalization that can scale beyond exact classical diagonalization methods. These workflows use a quantum circuit to sample candidate configurations, then iteratively refine the configurations and diagonalize the system’s Hamiltonian in the reduced subspace spanned by those configurations.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"Alat ini menyediakan keupayaan untuk membina aliran kerja bagi menganggarkan nilai eigen Hamiltonian kuantum, seperti tenaga keadaan asas sesuatu molekul, menggunakan pendekatan seperti pepenjuruan kuantum berasaskan sampel yang boleh berskala melangkaui kaedah pepenjuruan klasik tepat. Aliran kerja ini menggunakan litar kuantum untuk mensampel konfigurasi calon, kemudian memperhalusi konfigurasi tersebut secara berulang dan mempepenjurukan Hamiltonian sistem dalam subruang terturun yang direntangi oleh konfigurasi tersebut.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization\"\n"
"      description=\"Estimate the spectrum of quantum Hamiltonians by processing noisy samples and diagonalizing in a reduced subspace.\"\n"
"      href=\"/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Pepenjuruan kuantum berasaskan sampel\"\n"
"      description=\"Anggarkan spektrum Hamiltonian kuantum dengan memproses sampel berhingar dan mempepenjurukan dalam subruang terturun.\"\n"
"      href=\"/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd\"\n"
