# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow verification tools {#workflow-verification-tools}"
msgstr "Alat pengesahan aliran kerja {#workflow-verification-tools}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These tools are used for verifying workflows through classical simulation. They can simulate certain classes of circuits more efficiently than a general-purpose quantum circuit simulator. You can use them to check a workflow, such as an excitation-preserving ansatz or fermionic circuit, against a classical reference result before running it on quantum hardware.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"Alat ini digunakan untuk mengesahkan aliran kerja melalui simulasi klasik. Ia boleh mensimulasikan kelas litar tertentu dengan lebih cekap daripada simulator litar kuantum umum. Anda boleh menggunakannya untuk menyemak aliran kerja, seperti ansatz pemeliharaan pengujaan atau litar fermion, terhadap hasil rujukan klasik sebelum menjalankannya pada perkakasan kuantum.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"ffsim\"\n"
"      description=\"Simulate fermionic quantum circuits which conserve particle number and the z component of spin.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/ffsim/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"ffsim\"\n"
"      description=\"Simulasikan litar kuantum fermion yang memelihara bilangan zarah dan komponen z bagi spin.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/ffsim/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Layari dokumentasi\"\n"
"    />\n"

